     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">I created a heat map and then tried to download this plot using the</font> <span style=\"color:rgb(76,136,107);font-family:&#39;Source Code Pro&#39;,&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:inherit;background-color:transparent;line-height:1.428571429;white-space:pre-wrap\">file download wizard. </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:1.428571429;white-space:pre-wrap\">However, I could download its corresponding table, but failed to download the plot. Could </span><span style=\"line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap\">anyone help me on this?</span></font></span><div><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Source Code Pro, DejaVu Sans Mono, Droid Sans Mono, Lucida Console, Consolas, Monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\">The download table command in </font><font color=\"#ff0000\">Server.R</font><font color=\"#000000\"> looks like this and this works:</font></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Source Code Pro, DejaVu Sans Mono, Droid Sans Mono, Lucida Console, Consolas, Monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></font></span></div><div><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">downloadTable</span> &lt;- downloadHandler(</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">    <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">filename</span> = <span style=\"color:#c38809\">function</span>() { </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>paste(<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;mytable.csv&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">sep</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;&#39;</span>)},</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">    <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">content</span> = <span style=\"color:#c38809\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">file</span>) {</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">      <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>write.csv(datasetInput(), <span style=\"color:#000000\">file</span>)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">    <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>}</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">    )</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">And download figure is this, which it does not work:</font></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">output</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">downloadFigure</span> &lt;- downloadHandler(</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">    <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">filename</span> = <span style=\"color:#c38809\">function</span>() { </p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>paste(</span>&#39;heatmap.png&#39;<span style=\"color:#061a99\">)},</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">    <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">content</span> = <span style=\"color:#c38809\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">file</span>) {</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\">    <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>png(</span>&quot;heatmap.png&quot;<span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">       <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>plotInput()</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">       <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>dev.off()</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">    <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>}</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">    )</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\">The error message I got was: </font></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#ff0000\">Error opening file: 2</font></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#ff0000\">Error reading: 9</font></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:18px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#ff0000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-seri